WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,590
Why did Zhou Siyu go to the toilet?

2
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:08,590
Doesn't he smell bad after being stuck in traffic for several days?

3
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:11,170
What Sister Ying said

4
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:15,120
When does he stop smelling?

5
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,120
I tell you

6
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,120
The last time I bought snacks

7
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,120
He bought a box of chocolates

8
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,250
I've never taken it out in the past few days.

9
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,250
I guess he hid me

10
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:27,310
What are you hiding in the toilet and eating secretly right now?

11
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:29,700
How could he be so shameless?

12
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,570
He actually hid food secretly

13
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:37,570
Lin Dong, please hurry up.

14
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:52,580
What are you doing, baby?

15
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:55,580
Then I'll bake it for you. Don't worry.

16
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:56,900
except ham sausage

17
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,900
Is there nothing else I can eat?

18
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:00,990
Feng Yi, don’t you have super powers?

19
00:01:00,990 --> 00:01:02,990
Go get me my favorite food from that backstreet restaurant

20
00:01:02,990 --> 00:01:04,990
Bring me the desserts from the dessert shop.

21
00:01:04,990 --> 00:01:07,760
Eat these junk foods every day

22
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,760
I'm tired of it
